WEBVTT

00:07:29.736 --> 00:07:32.545
which was even closer
to the epicenter of that earthquake

00:07:32.569 --> 00:07:35.444
than the infamous Fukushima Daiichi
that we all know about.

00:07:36.319 --> 00:07:41.378
In Onagawa, people in the city
actually fled to the nuclear power plant

00:07:41.402 --> 00:07:43.378
as a place of refuge.

00:07:43.402 --> 00:07:45.253
It was that safe.

00:07:45.277 --> 00:07:47.027
It was spared by the tsunamis.

00:07:48.111 --> 00:07:50.628
It was the foresight of just one engineer,

00:07:50.652 --> 00:07:52.628
Yanosuke Hirai,

00:07:52.652 --> 00:07:53.902
that made that happen.

00:07:54.986 --> 00:07:58.753
In the 1960s, he fought
to build that power plant

00:07:58.777 --> 00:08:00.462
farther back from the coast